---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  props:  hourlyData: HourBucket[] + touInsights: TouInsights|null        → TimeOfUseInput{hourly:[TimeOfUseHour]?, insights:TimeOfUseInsightsData?} (P1/S8 seam)
  hook:   useChartPalette()                                               → TSChartPalette (mid-peak bar/legend fill = palette[0])
  shell:  <GlassPanel className="p-4">                                    → TSFadeIn + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border)
  title:  Clock + t('costAnalysis.tou.title','Electricity Rate Analysis…') → header: SF "clock" (statusWarning) + TimeOfUseStrings title + freshness chip + refresh
  chart:  Recharts <BarChart> per-hour <Cell> fill (peak #ef4444 / off    → Swift Charts Chart{ BarMark }.foregroundStyle(band) ; peak→statusDanger,
          #10b981 / mid palette[0]); <XAxis interval={2}>,<YAxis>,<Tooltip>    off-peak→statusSuccess, mid→TSChartPalette[0]; x-axis every-3rd label;
                                                                              y-axis leading int + grid; .chartXSelection RuleMark → TimeOfUseChartTooltip
  band:   isPeak 14..19 ; isOffPeak >=22||<6 ; else mid                   → TimeOfUseBand.classify(hour:) (pure, unit-tested at every boundary)
  legend: Peak / Mid-peak / Off-peak swatches                            → TimeOfUseLegend (same TimeOfUseBandPalette fills as the bars — never disagree)
  rail:   <h4>Insights</h4> + 4 GlassPanels                              → TimeOfUseInsightsColumn + 4 TimeOfUseInsightCardView
  cards:  Cheapest(green)/Priciest(red)/Busiest(cyan)/Off-Peak%(emerald) → tones positive/negative/accent/positive → statusSuccess/statusDanger/statusInfo
  fmt:    fmtNumber(avgCost,3) "$"+ ; fmtInt(sessions) ; fmtNumber(pct,1) → TimeOfUseNumber.number/.integer (port of numberFormat.ts, half-up, grouping)
  copy:   "avg ${cost} / session" · "{n} sessions" · "{pct}%"            → TimeOfUseProjection.avgCostCaption/sessionsCaption (web keys avgCost/perSession/sessions)
  empty1: hourlyData.length===0 → t('costAnalysis.charts.noData')        → TimeOfUseChartEmpty ("Not enough data", keeps chart footprint)
  empty2: touInsights===null → t('costAnalysis.tou.noInsights')          → TimeOfUseInsightsEmpty ("No insights available")
  i18n:   costAnalysis.tou.* + costAnalysis.charts.noData (verbatim keys) → resolved through TimeOfUseStrings facade (table "TimeOfUseAnalysis")
  layout: grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 (chart span-2 + rail span-1)        → ViewThatFits: side-by-side (HStack) on wide, stacked (VStack) on compact

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → TimeOfUseLoadingView (TSSkeleton chart columns + insight tiles; reduce-motion safe)
  data     → TimeOfUseBarChart + legend + 4 insight cards (the web body)
  empty(1) → TimeOfUseChartEmpty   (web hourlyData empty branch — inline, never blank)
  empty(2) → TimeOfUseInsightsEmpty (web touInsights null branch — inline, never blank)
  error    → TimeOfUseErrorView (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())  [P4 leaf]
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached numbers, no refetch
a11y: container summary (title), per-column VoiceOver value (sessions · band),
  insight-cell combined label (title: value. caption), header trait, refresh
  label, reduce-motion animation gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"TimeOfUseAnalysis") emitted once on appear.

